{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/sell/layout,_N_T_/sell/page,_N_T_/sell"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--oweG6OEEJOkVD2LlWXnjh--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-62902f04efbdd792.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f10ca8562d68747b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/sell/page-4274fde1085910c9.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Sell Your Home | Lathrop Team</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sell your Fox Cities home with a three-generation team and a RealTrends verified record.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"site\"><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"page page-sell\"><div class=\"\"><header class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Sell with confidence</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Sell your Fox Cities home with a proven team</h2></header></div><div class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"\"><p>In 2024, our RealTrends verified performance recorded $27.24M in closed volume across 76 transaction sides. We use that experience to price, market, and negotiate your sale with confidence.</p><h3>A clear, four-step plan</h3><ol class=\"sell-steps\"><li><strong>Accurate valuation.</strong> We analyze recent sales, local trends, and your home’s unique features—not just a generic online estimate.</li><li><strong>Preparation and presentation.</strong> Guidance on repair priorities, staging, and professional photography.</li><li><strong>Strategic marketing.</strong> Listing syndication, targeted digital exposure, and communication with our network.</li><li><strong>Negotiation and closing.</strong> We handle offers, counters, inspection responses, and closing details.</li></ol><p>Our team’s performance has been verified by RealTrends, an independent industry source that tracks production nationwide.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"page-cta\"><p>Start with a free home valuation.</p><a href=\"/home-valuation\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary\">Get my home value</button></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"site-logo\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></div><p>Three-generation Fox Cities real estate team with a RealTrends verified record and 525+ five-star reviews.</p></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><p>Diane Lathrop · (920) 428-9227 · diane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Shane Lathrop · (920) 428-0066 · shane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Oliver Lathrop · (920) 858-4424 · oliver@lathropteam.com</p></div><div class=\"footer-kw\"><strong>Keller Williams Fox Cities</strong><p>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI</p><p>Each office is independently owned and operated.</p></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[245,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[7831,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[1356,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n7:I[5413,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"499\\\",\\\"static/